68356	68403	68346	68347	the man	10015	“ my name is Salvation Yeo , born in Clovelly Street , in the year 1526 , where my father exercised the mystery of a barber surgeon , and a preacher of the people since called Anabaptists , for which I return humble thanks to God . ”
