128678	128754	129663	129664	Don Guzman	1264	“ It was true ; Lara , maddened with drink , rage , and wounds , had caught up his sword , rushed into the thick of the fight , singled out the traitor , and slain him on the spot ; and then , forgetting safety in revenge , had continued to plunge his sword into the corpse , heedless of the blows of the savages , till he fell pierced with a hundred wounds .
