137370	137521	137368	137368	CAMPBELL	1371	“ So you see , my dear Mrs. Hawkins , having the silver , as your own eyes show you , beside the ores of lead , manganese , and copper , and above all this gossan ( as the Cornish call it ) , which I suspect to be not merely the matrix of the ore , but also the very crude form and materia prima of all metals -- you mark me?--If my recipes , which I had from Doctor Dee , succeed only half so well as I expect , then I refine out the luna , the silver , lay it by , and transmute the remaining ores into sol , gold . Whereupon Peru and Mexico become superfluities , and England the mistress of the globe . Strange , no doubt ; distant , no doubt : but possible , my dear madam , possible ! ”
