234468	234609	234463	234463	he	7696	“ Alas ! miserable me ! Alas ! unhappy senors ! Do my old eyes deceive me , and is it one of those evil visions of the past which haunt my dreams by night ; or has the accursed thirst of gold , the ruin of my race , penetrated even into this my solitude ? Oh , senors , senors , know you not that you bear with you your own poison , your own familiar fiend , the root of every evil ? And is it not enough for you , senors , to load yourselves with the wedge of Achan , and partake his doom , but you must make these hapless heathens the victims of your greed and cruelty , and forestall for them on earth those torments which may await their unbaptized souls hereafter ? ”
