251520	251615	251493	251494	the commandant	7904	“ Simply enough , and owing neither to witch nor miracle . The night before last we passed the mouth of the bay in our two canoes , which we had lashed together after the fashion I had seen in the Moluccas , to keep them afloat in the surf . We had scraped the canoes bright the day before , and rubbed them with white clay , that they might be invisible at night ; and so we got safely to the Morro Grande , passing within half a mile of your ship . ”
